  "name": "Celestial Storm Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "Given to players at the Celestial Storm prerelease tournaments on the weekends of 21–22 and 28–29 July 2018, and sold in shops from 17 August 2018. Each box held four Celestial Storm booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Celestial Storm logo. The packs also held non-holo copies of Metagross and Delcatty, which booster packs have only in holofoil.",
